WEBVTT

00:00:00.660 --> 00:00:02.450
To "the prison that is Academia"?

00:00:03.380 --> 00:00:05.550
I won't abandon Serena to a place like that!

00:00:05.960 --> 00:00:07.880
Try to understand, Yuya!

00:00:07.880 --> 00:00:11.220
This is the only way to save Yuzu!

00:00:11.880 --> 00:00:13.900
Academia needs to be defeated.

00:00:14.630 --> 00:00:17.310
If you're going to work, work for that!

00:00:17.310 --> 00:00:19.230
You need to wake up soon, Sora.

00:00:20.670 --> 00:00:21.800
Look out!

00:00:22.800 --> 00:00:23.640
Yuya!

00:00:23.950 --> 00:00:25.450
Protect Yuzu!

00:00:32.080 --> 00:00:34.350
Intrigue swirls here, at the Friendship Cup.

00:00:34.800 --> 00:00:40.540
Have there been backdoor dealings between the 
Public Order Bureau, on the sponsor side,

00:00:40.540 --> 00:00:42.790
and Yuya Sakaki, on the participants'?

00:00:43.200 --> 00:00:44.990
No one cares!

00:00:53.760 --> 00:00:55.780
Let us duel already!

00:00:58.020 --> 00:00:59.640
D-Wheels.

00:01:00.240 --> 00:01:03.840
Riding duels are fought while 
racing on these machines,

00:01:03.840 --> 00:01:05.530
which are an evolution of the duel disks.

00:01:05.530 --> 00:01:08.970
They combine speed and thrills for the ultimate show,

00:01:08.970 --> 00:01:11.100
a symbol of freedom to all.

00:02:45.180 --> 00:02:50.020
Each Man's Battlefield

00:02:50.500 --> 00:02:53.420
I'd love to go after the scoop,

00:02:53.420 --> 00:02:56.950
but for now, I'll present you with this fiery duel!

00:03:00.160 --> 00:03:02.840
No one will do anything for me.

00:03:02.840 --> 00:03:05.530
If I don't win my way to the top, 
nothing will change.

00:03:05.530 --> 00:03:08.000
I'll crush anyone who stands in my way.

00:03:08.360 --> 00:03:11.700
It's the only way to expose all my enemies.

00:03:12.340 --> 00:03:13.920
Now, let's go.

00:03:13.920 --> 00:03:15.820
Action Field, on!

00:03:15.820 --> 00:03:18.340
Field Spell Crossover Acceleration!

00:03:22.450 --> 00:03:23.880
Duel mode, on.

00:03:23.880 --> 00:03:25.880
Autopilot, stand by.

00:03:29.490 --> 00:03:33.350
Riding duel... Acceleration!

00:03:35.160 --> 00:03:35.980
Duel!

00:03:37.160 --> 00:03:40.330
Crow and Kurosaki both rush out, at full throttle.

00:03:40.330 --> 00:03:44.440
The first out of the Duel Palace, to enter 
the course, earns the first turn.

00:03:44.800 --> 00:03:47.770
Incidentally, the course selected for this match

00:03:47.770 --> 00:03:52.620
is the loop line that circles the city center.

00:03:53.320 --> 00:03:55.880
The organizers probably thought

00:03:55.880 --> 00:04:01.090
a longer course would cause more trouble 
if someone destroyed it, right?

00:04:01.360 --> 00:04:06.560
I could easily cover any costs 
with donations by the Tops.

00:04:06.560 --> 00:04:12.160
I merely wish to not damage the fine scenery 
of a place that is about to be mine.

00:04:15.200 --> 00:04:18.360
Academia has infiltrated every 
corner of this place.

00:04:18.360 --> 00:04:20.620
If you're one of them, I won't show any mercy.

00:04:21.090 --> 00:04:23.510
Stop talking about stuff I don't understand.

00:04:25.510 --> 00:04:26.980
Crow takes the first move!

00:04:26.980 --> 00:04:30.570
I'll win my way to the top, and avenge my allies!

00:04:30.570 --> 00:04:34.330
Shinji isn't the only one who can forge 
bonds among the Commons!

00:04:34.330 --> 00:04:35.610
My turn!

00:04:35.610 --> 00:04:39.590
I summon Blackwing — Jetstream the Blue Sky!

00:04:44.090 --> 00:04:47.310
And when there's a Blackwing 
on my side of the field,

00:04:47.310 --> 00:04:52.300
I can Special Summon Tuner Monster Blackwing 
— Oroshi the Squall from my hand!

00:04:57.100 --> 00:05:02.480
Level 1 Oroshi the Squall tunes 
Level 1 Jetstream the Blue Sky!

00:05:02.480 --> 00:05:06.450
Flap your ebony wings and slice through 
the wind with your hidden blade!

00:05:07.000 --> 00:05:08.190
Synchro Summon!

00:05:08.540 --> 00:05:12.660
Spread your wings, Assault Blackwing 
— Sayo the Rain Hider!

00:05:13.540 --> 00:05:16.970
I activate my Equip Spell Charging Blade!

00:05:19.050 --> 00:05:22.930
The attack points of the monster 
I equip it to increase by 800.

00:05:23.410 --> 00:05:25.340
Charging Blade's effect.

00:05:25.340 --> 00:05:29.160
Once per turn, I deal you 400 
times the number of monsters

00:05:29.160 --> 00:05:32.610
used to Synchro Summon the equipped monster!

00:05:36.160 --> 00:05:38.550
Wow! Early damage!

00:05:38.890 --> 00:05:41.250
You see the power of the bonds between Commons?

00:05:41.720 --> 00:05:45.360
We call to our allies, and fight 
with the bonds between us.

00:05:45.750 --> 00:05:47.670
This is how Commons fight!

00:05:50.480 --> 00:05:55.000
Taking effect damage lets me 
Special Summon this card.

00:05:55.760 --> 00:05:58.470
Raidraptor — Avenge Vulture!

00:05:58.860 --> 00:06:01.350
You wouldn't let it go unanswered, huh?

00:06:01.350 --> 00:06:04.440
But that isn't enough to shake the 
bonds shared by Commons.

00:06:04.850 --> 00:06:07.990
I set one card and end my turn!

00:06:08.650 --> 00:06:10.240
I will defeat you!

00:06:10.240 --> 00:06:12.620
Afterward, I'll decide whether 
you're friend or foe.

00:06:13.390 --> 00:06:14.820
My turn!

00:06:15.280 --> 00:06:18.430
I select one Raidraptor on my side of the field,

00:06:18.430 --> 00:06:22.590
and Special Summon Raidraptor 
— Pain Lanius from my hand!

00:06:26.320 --> 00:06:31.070
This card's level equals that of the selected 
monster until the end of my turn.

00:06:31.700 --> 00:06:37.580
And I take damage equal to the attack or 
defense points of the monster I selected.

00:06:37.580 --> 00:06:38.410
What?

00:06:39.860 --> 00:06:43.460
I take 100 damage, equal to Avenge 
Vulture's defense points.

00:06:44.840 --> 00:06:49.670
Taking effect damage lets me summon 
a second Avenge Vulture!

00:06:51.920 --> 00:06:55.060
Taking damage to summon another monster?

00:06:55.470 --> 00:06:58.440
When I have three or more 
Raidraptors on the field,

00:06:58.440 --> 00:07:02.900
I can activate my spell card Raidraptor 
— Sanctuary from my hand!

00:07:04.540 --> 00:07:06.500
I draw two cards from my deck!

00:07:07.350 --> 00:07:11.990
Battle! I attack Sayo the Rain 
Hider with Avenge Vulture!

00:07:13.870 --> 00:07:17.550
Sayo the Rain Hider can avoid 
destruction twice in a turn!

00:07:17.960 --> 00:07:21.250
I attack with my other Avenge Vulture.

00:07:21.250 --> 00:07:23.350
I negate destruction a second time!

00:07:25.800 --> 00:07:27.560
I endured your attacks.

00:07:27.810 --> 00:07:32.300
I activate my Quick-Play Spell 
Raidraptor — Rapid Xyz!

00:07:33.260 --> 00:07:36.940
When you have a Special Summoned 
monster on your side of the field,

00:07:36.940 --> 00:07:39.660
I can Xyz Summon during battle.

00:07:39.660 --> 00:07:40.740
During battle?

00:07:41.110 --> 00:07:46.250
I overlay my Level 4 Avenge 
Vultures and Pain Lanius!

00:07:48.920 --> 00:07:53.820
Hidden falcon, raise your sharpened 
claws from adversity

00:07:53.820 --> 00:07:56.010
and show your wings of rebellion!

00:07:56.790 --> 00:07:58.160
Xyz Summon!

00:07:58.160 --> 00:08:03.060
Appear, Rank 4 Raidraptor — Rise Falcon!

00:08:05.130 --> 00:08:07.670
What a presence!

00:08:08.440 --> 00:08:12.550
When I use Rapid Xyz to Xyz Summon a monster,

00:08:12.960 --> 00:08:16.210
I can activate effects that use an Overlay Unit.

00:08:16.210 --> 00:08:19.810
I use one of Raid Falcon's Overlay Units.

00:08:20.280 --> 00:08:26.440
It adds the sum of the attack points of 
monsters on your field to its own.

00:08:28.040 --> 00:08:31.260
What? Give me a break with 
those cheater effects!

00:08:31.810 --> 00:08:33.730
Go, Rise Falcon!

00:08:33.730 --> 00:08:35.790
Attack Sayo the Rain Hider!

00:08:44.390 --> 00:08:47.370
Rise Falcon's effect ends with my End Phase,

00:08:47.370 --> 00:08:49.370
and its attack points return to normal.

00:08:49.700 --> 00:08:50.890
I end my turn.

00:08:51.660 --> 00:08:54.910
Kurosaki, with a powerful Xyz Summon!

00:08:55.250 --> 00:08:59.580
I'm sorry I'm the only one who can 
watch from this special seat!

00:09:02.680 --> 00:09:08.030
I can't have you thinking that one monster's 
destruction is enough to sever our bonds.

00:09:08.030 --> 00:09:10.810
No matter what you throw at me, I'll destroy it.

00:09:10.810 --> 00:09:13.330
I can't afford to be crushed, either!

00:09:24.100 --> 00:09:25.980
We can get to the highway from there.

00:09:26.450 --> 00:09:28.280
I bet it's started already!

00:09:28.280 --> 00:09:29.710
Hurry up, Yuzu.

00:09:29.960 --> 00:09:30.840
Okay...

00:09:33.920 --> 00:09:35.720
Where's Yuya?

00:09:36.150 --> 00:09:38.920
Roget didn't cancel the tournament.

00:09:39.410 --> 00:09:42.010
I'm sure Yuya will continue to participate.

00:09:43.020 --> 00:09:46.960
But it's likely that Roget wants 
to bring Yuya to his side.

00:09:48.200 --> 00:09:50.640
I've brought Yuya Sakaki.

00:09:50.640 --> 00:09:51.570
Enter.

00:09:54.580 --> 00:09:56.110
I'll speak to him alone.

00:09:56.110 --> 00:09:58.010
The rest of you, take your leave.

00:09:58.010 --> 00:09:58.760
Yes, sir.

00:10:01.750 --> 00:10:03.980
You're not sending me to prison?

00:10:03.980 --> 00:10:07.200
I shall not subject you to that again.

00:10:07.200 --> 00:10:09.870
You are my important guest.

00:10:09.870 --> 00:10:10.970
Guest?

00:10:11.920 --> 00:10:13.290
Crow and Kurosaki!

00:10:13.290 --> 00:10:15.310
I'd like you to watch carefully.

00:10:15.650 --> 00:10:19.900
The winner of this duel could be your next opponent.

00:10:21.370 --> 00:10:24.060
And I do wish for you to win...

00:10:24.060 --> 00:10:26.340
In accordance with my plans.

00:10:27.300 --> 00:10:28.570
Plans...

00:10:34.480 --> 00:10:37.640
I've been pushed to the brink of despair.

00:10:37.640 --> 00:10:40.170
I've wandered through a living hell.

00:10:40.170 --> 00:10:43.310
Your mere determination will 
do nothing against me.

00:10:43.310 --> 00:10:47.910
You don't know that, when you 
know nothing about Commons!

00:10:48.740 --> 00:10:49.960
My turn!

00:10:50.880 --> 00:10:55.170
I summon Blackwing — Tornado 
the Reverse Wind!

00:10:59.800 --> 00:11:02.480
Tornado the Reverse Wind's monster effect.

00:11:02.480 --> 00:11:05.610
When there's a monster 
on your side of the field,

00:11:05.970 --> 00:11:10.080
I can Special Summon one Level 1 
Tuner Monster from the graveyard.

00:11:10.080 --> 00:11:12.380
Come out, Oroshi the Squall!

00:11:14.190 --> 00:11:19.890
Level 1 Oroshi the Squall tunes Level 4 
Tornado the Reverse Wind!

00:11:22.620 --> 00:11:26.330
Ebony gale, become the tailwind 
that binds us together!

00:11:26.760 --> 00:11:28.030
Synchro Summon!

00:11:28.030 --> 00:11:32.680
Fly high, Assault Blackwing — 
Sohaya the Rain Storm!

00:11:34.010 --> 00:11:36.990
When I Synchro Summon 
Sohaya the Rain Storm,

00:11:36.990 --> 00:11:41.140
I can Special Summon one Assault 
Blackwing from my graveyard.

00:11:41.140 --> 00:11:43.540
Come out, Sayo the Rain Hider!

00:11:45.040 --> 00:11:50.330
And when Sohaya the Rain Storm is used 
as a component in a Synchro Summon,

00:11:50.330 --> 00:11:53.430
it can be used as a Tuner Monster.

00:11:53.430 --> 00:11:54.130
What?

00:11:54.520 --> 00:11:59.980
Spread your ebony wings, and strike the 
ground with the speed of lightning!

00:12:01.320 --> 00:12:02.530
Synchro Summon!

00:12:02.860 --> 00:12:07.270
Rain down, Assault Blackwing — 
Raikiri the Rain Shower!

00:12:07.270 --> 00:12:12.510
There it is! He finishes a series of Synchro 
Summons to bring out his ace monster!

00:12:12.890 --> 00:12:15.110
I activate Raikiri the Rain Shower's effect!

00:12:15.110 --> 00:12:20.080
For every Blackwing on the field, 
I can destroy one of your cards!

00:12:20.080 --> 00:12:22.590
Get lost, Rise Falcon.

00:12:31.900 --> 00:12:34.580
Action Spell Mirror Barrier...

00:12:34.580 --> 00:12:37.340
Its effect negates one monster's destruction.

00:12:40.810 --> 00:12:42.430
Then, battle.

00:12:42.430 --> 00:12:45.530
I attack Rise Falcon with Raikiri the Rain Shower!

00:12:46.890 --> 00:12:51.220
I send Raidraptor — Booster Strix 
from my hand to the graveyard,

00:12:51.620 --> 00:12:54.690
to use one Overlay Unit on Rise Falcon.

00:12:57.180 --> 00:13:00.090
It lets me negate the attack!

00:13:04.360 --> 00:13:06.030
You even negated the battle?

00:13:06.030 --> 00:13:09.580
And the effect granted by Boost Strix

00:13:09.580 --> 00:13:11.880
lets me use another Overlay Unit.

00:13:12.240 --> 00:13:16.890
I destroy the monster whose attack 
against Rise Falcon was negated!

00:13:19.010 --> 00:13:20.440
Not so fast!

00:13:20.440 --> 00:13:22.860
Continuous Trap Blade Shade!

00:13:24.600 --> 00:13:31.190
Once per turn, I can negate Raikiri's 
destruction by attacks or effects.

00:13:31.520 --> 00:13:36.890
And when I use this effect, 
I deal 500 damage to you!

00:13:40.190 --> 00:13:41.530
I end my turn.

00:13:41.530 --> 00:13:43.720
Now, bring it on...

00:13:43.720 --> 00:13:46.500
I don't have time to play war with you!

00:13:46.870 --> 00:13:49.300
I'm not playing war.

00:13:49.300 --> 00:13:53.950
Since the day my homeland was stolen 
and my little sister kidnapped,

00:13:53.950 --> 00:13:57.220
every place I go becomes a battlefield!

00:13:59.710 --> 00:14:01.370
Isn't that Crow?

00:14:01.370 --> 00:14:02.650
Where?

00:14:04.030 --> 00:14:07.090
What do you mean, win in 
accordance with your plans?

00:14:07.090 --> 00:14:10.280
I shall soon assume control of City.

00:14:10.280 --> 00:14:12.800
Rather, I already have.

00:14:13.180 --> 00:14:14.780
Reiji... Layra!

00:14:14.780 --> 00:14:15.770
You...

00:14:15.770 --> 00:14:18.080
It is all for the sake of City.

00:14:18.080 --> 00:14:23.980
And to move this plan forward, 
I require your aid.

00:14:26.530 --> 00:14:30.010
If you want to wage war that much, 
do it somewhere else.

00:14:30.010 --> 00:14:34.600
There's probably still a traitor 
among you Lancers...

00:14:34.600 --> 00:14:39.020
So, before they make contact with the 
Tops and cause havoc, get lost!

00:14:39.020 --> 00:14:42.890
I don't think of myself as one of the Lancers!

00:14:45.140 --> 00:14:46.110
Here he comes.

00:14:46.110 --> 00:14:49.480
I only ally myself with those I lost in my hometown.

00:14:49.480 --> 00:14:51.470
Everyone else is the enemy!

00:14:51.470 --> 00:14:52.950
Kurosaki...

00:14:53.440 --> 00:14:54.780
Crow!

00:14:54.780 --> 00:14:55.910
Good luck!

00:14:58.510 --> 00:15:01.820
It is an ugly duel, full of insults and abuse.

00:15:01.820 --> 00:15:03.880
Not at all like your duels.

00:15:04.200 --> 00:15:08.920
Jack Atlas, Duel Chaser 227, Shinji Weber...

00:15:09.460 --> 00:15:13.990
The duels you fought with them 
resonated with me.

00:15:16.310 --> 00:15:20.560
You don't want to win duels by 
dominating your opponent.

00:15:21.220 --> 00:15:25.500
I could tell that by the way that you fought.

00:15:25.960 --> 00:15:30.660
You are struggling to accomplish 
something more with your duel.

00:15:30.980 --> 00:15:35.120
Something that brings winner, 
loser, and spectator together,

00:15:35.120 --> 00:15:38.180
in happiness, peace, and love.

00:15:39.810 --> 00:15:40.870
Smiles.

00:15:41.730 --> 00:15:43.890
I want to use my duel to bring smiles to everyone.

00:15:44.550 --> 00:15:46.620
How splendid!

00:15:46.620 --> 00:15:51.590
That message of yours will 
certainly reach the people.

00:15:53.970 --> 00:15:58.400
It is true that, as Jack so keenly 
perceived, your duels

00:15:58.800 --> 00:16:02.000
are yet unrefined as entertainment.

00:16:04.650 --> 00:16:08.080
But every time you win, you evolve.

00:16:08.660 --> 00:16:12.780
If you keep winning and stand at the 
top, bringing smiles to everyone,

00:16:13.180 --> 00:16:16.490
your duels will be perfected, in the 
truest sense of the word.

00:16:18.960 --> 00:16:21.790
To make people smile with your duels...

00:16:21.790 --> 00:16:26.700
That means eliminating conflict from the world.

00:16:27.090 --> 00:16:32.940
You are throwing body and soul into 
that clean, pure ideal, aren't you?

00:16:34.410 --> 00:16:37.860
I agree with you from the bottom of my heart.

00:16:40.710 --> 00:16:44.180
I hate reckless jerks like Kurosaki!

00:16:44.480 --> 00:16:46.160
He stinks.

00:16:46.160 --> 00:16:48.140
And he trashed the place in his duel with Dennis.

00:16:48.140 --> 00:16:51.310
I hope Crow smashes him to bits!

00:16:51.310 --> 00:16:55.920
Kurosaki's home was attacked by 
Academia, and he lost everything.

00:16:55.920 --> 00:16:56.530
That's why...

00:16:56.920 --> 00:16:58.460
We're the same.

00:17:00.520 --> 00:17:03.420
We haven't had anything, from the start.

00:17:03.420 --> 00:17:07.590
But we never do reckless things like he does.

00:17:08.040 --> 00:17:12.620
Well, okay, we do steal a little food sometimes...

00:17:13.700 --> 00:17:16.760
But when we do, Crow gets mad at us.

00:17:16.760 --> 00:17:18.450
He tells us we need to live honestly.

00:17:18.770 --> 00:17:21.020
We must endure, not getting beat down,

00:17:21.020 --> 00:17:26.160
because by the time we're grown up, 
he'll make a proper world to live in.

00:17:28.480 --> 00:17:31.200
I love peace, as well.

00:17:31.200 --> 00:17:33.870
What I seek is a world without conflict, without war,

00:17:33.870 --> 00:17:36.830
where everyone passes lives of quiet contentment.

00:17:37.460 --> 00:17:40.140
A world without the labels of 
"Tops" and "Commons,"

00:17:40.140 --> 00:17:43.440
where everyone can live in happiness.

00:17:44.610 --> 00:17:48.920
If you would help me, I could make it a reality.

00:17:49.320 --> 00:17:53.900
Would you take my hand, and begin 
walking toward that ideal together?

00:17:53.900 --> 00:17:55.420
As the first step toward that,

00:17:55.890 --> 00:18:00.390
you must win the Friendship Cup 
and beat Jack Atlas!

00:18:02.860 --> 00:18:08.300
The worthy king of the world I 
wish to crown is not Jack.

00:18:08.740 --> 00:18:13.150
It is a pure, proper, idealistic duelist like you.

00:18:13.150 --> 00:18:16.340
Then why arrest me and bring me here?

00:18:17.590 --> 00:18:21.350
I merely wanted to ensure your safety.

00:18:21.350 --> 00:18:24.040
But the way you did it...

00:18:24.040 --> 00:18:27.550
Actually, we were after the other boy.

00:18:27.950 --> 00:18:29.050
Sora?

00:18:29.340 --> 00:18:32.520
Sora? Is that his name?

00:18:32.520 --> 00:18:34.230
But why Sora?

00:18:34.570 --> 00:18:40.740
Obviously, because I deemed him 
a threat to the peace of City.

00:18:41.400 --> 00:18:44.200
He is from Academia, is he not?

00:18:45.360 --> 00:18:48.410
Wait a minute... Sora's my friend!

00:18:48.950 --> 00:18:52.700
He said he came to this dimension 
to save Yuzu from Academia.

00:18:53.120 --> 00:18:55.750
And you believed him?

00:18:55.750 --> 00:18:58.800
The people of Academia do not have friends.

00:18:58.800 --> 00:19:03.450
They trust only one person, the Professor.

00:19:04.100 --> 00:19:07.440
But even if I don't know why,

00:19:07.440 --> 00:19:10.590
I have to do what the Professor orders.

00:19:11.410 --> 00:19:13.540
That is the rule at Academia.

00:19:16.400 --> 00:19:18.900
He will betray you, without fail.

00:19:19.440 --> 00:19:21.440
I know this for a fact.

00:19:22.040 --> 00:19:25.740
Because I originally came from Academia myself.

00:19:36.380 --> 00:19:39.040
Why is security so heavy here?

00:19:39.040 --> 00:19:42.130
I need to get to Yuzu, fast.

00:19:48.100 --> 00:19:50.250
None of you are on my side.

00:19:50.250 --> 00:19:51.940
I will defeat you.

00:19:51.940 --> 00:19:53.340
My turn!

00:19:55.070 --> 00:19:58.900
I activate Rank-Up-Magic 
Raid Force from my hand!

00:20:00.780 --> 00:20:04.830
I use Rise Falcon on my side of the 
field as an overlay component.

00:20:04.830 --> 00:20:08.570
I Xyz Summon a Raid Raptor of one rank higher!

00:20:09.960 --> 00:20:11.220
Rank-Up?

00:20:11.720 --> 00:20:17.720
Ferocious falcon, cut through fierce 
battles and flap your wings

00:20:17.720 --> 00:20:19.830
to defeat your enemies.

00:20:20.130 --> 00:20:22.880
Rank Up Xyz Change.

00:20:22.880 --> 00:20:27.720
Appear! Rank 5 Raidraptor — Blaze Falcon!

00:20:29.150 --> 00:20:31.310
I activate Blaze Falcon's effect!

00:20:31.830 --> 00:20:33.640
I use one Overlay Unit

00:20:34.030 --> 00:20:37.680
to destroy all monsters Special Summoned 
to your side of the field,

00:20:37.680 --> 00:20:41.250
dealing you 500 points of damage for each.

00:20:45.740 --> 00:20:50.130
But Continuous Trap Blade Shade 
negates the destruction!

00:20:54.140 --> 00:20:59.340
And when I use that effect, 
it deals 500 damage to you!

00:21:02.680 --> 00:21:05.410
With only 1000 attack points, what's his plan?

00:21:05.760 --> 00:21:10.650
Blaze Falcon can attack you directly!

00:21:15.350 --> 00:21:18.990
When Blaze Falcon deals battle damage to you,

00:21:18.990 --> 00:21:22.860
I can destroy one monster 
on your side of the field!

00:21:27.560 --> 00:21:29.390
That's what he was after?

00:21:29.390 --> 00:21:33.470
The destruction of Raikiri destroys 
Blade Shade, as well!

00:21:34.360 --> 00:21:37.860
I set two cards and end my turn.

00:21:38.750 --> 00:21:43.340
Kurosaki realizes Crow can only 
use Blade Shade once per turn,

00:21:43.340 --> 00:21:46.910
and uses that chance to take 
out Crow's ace monster!

00:21:46.910 --> 00:21:51.760
I first came to City for my mission.

00:21:51.760 --> 00:21:56.040
But my interactions with the 
people of City changed me.

00:21:56.040 --> 00:22:00.860
From the bottom of my heart, 
I wish to build a perfect world.

00:22:01.240 --> 00:22:05.340
To make that a reality, I need you.

00:22:05.640 --> 00:22:09.310
Trust in me, Yuya!

00:23:49.840 --> 00:23:52.800
Give me all you've got. I'll finish you off.

00:23:53.180 --> 00:23:56.250
After I beat you, I have more enemies to defeat.

00:23:56.680 --> 00:23:59.820
Quit underestimating the bonds 
between Commons!

00:23:59.820 --> 00:24:02.720
When I use Gofu the Vague Shadow 
as a synchro component,

00:24:02.720 --> 00:24:06.250
I can Synchro Summon from my 
graveyard, not my Extra Deck!

00:24:06.250 --> 00:24:08.280
From your graveyard?

00:24:09.130 --> 00:24:15.000
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh! ARC-V: 
The Ultimate Falcon Versus the Black-Winged Lightning.

00:24:15.000 --> 00:24:16.870
The fun is only getting started!
